Seq, Nov 2012].","ncbi_source":"NCBI Gene summary (RefSeq), via MyGene.info","uniprot_function":[{"accession":"Q9NX74","text":"Catalyzes the NADPH-dependent synthesis of dihydrouridine, a modified base found in the D-loop of most tRNAs (PubMed:15994936, PubMed:26429968, PubMed:30149704, PubMed:34798057, PubMed:38680565). Specifically modifies U20 in cytoplasmic tRNAs (PubMed:38680565). Activity depends on the presence of guanosine at position 19 in the tRNA substrate (PubMed:38680565). Negatively regulates the activation of EIF2AK2/PKR (PubMed:18096616)."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_04","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}